# ceil c077g: c077 + the two natural gates as observers toggled by the plan on BOTH edges:
# (-1,-1) facing down powers BL parked at (-1,0) (its puller's front) -> E at (-1,1) = M (open only);
# (-2,2) facing west powers ML parked at (-1,2) -> E at (-2,1) by QC through (-2,2) = E2 (open only).
# D tapped on both edges. BL-left and E1 together (E1's ideal block QCs BL's puller anyway).
design designs/piston-door-3x3/tracks/ceil/wip/c077h.txt
